FeatureName: Color Wheel Selector

Description:
        This feature adds a color wheel to the interface, allowing users to pick
        any custom color in addition to the preset color buttons. The selected
        color becomes the active drawing color for all tools and can also be
        used with the Paint Bucket tool to recolor shapes on the canvas.

