FeatureName: EyeDropper Tool

Description:
		This feature allows the user to click on any already drawn shape on the canvas and
		change the currently selected color of the canvas to the color of the selected shape.
		This feature allows users to quickly reuse colors instead of attempting to find the color
		again in the color panel.

