FeatureName: Text Tool Color and Movement

Description:
		The Text Tool allows users to add text to the canvas. When a color is selected
		using the ColorChooserPanel, it is applied to any new text created. The text
		can be moved around the canvas after it is placed using the SelectMoveTool,
		giving users flexibility in repositioning it.

