FeatureName: Adaptable Canvas

Description:
		The canvas automatically adjusts its size based on the window size. When the
		user resizes the window, the canvas dynamically expands or contracts to fit
		within the new window dimensions. This ensures that the canvas remains responsive,
		providing an optimal user experience across various screen sizes without losing any
		drawing content.

